The '''Assassin''' is an [[Ascendancy class]] for [[Shadow]]s.

==Overview==
[[File:3.27 Assassin Ascendancy skill tree.png|290px|thumb|right|Assassin skill tree]]

The Assassin specialises in [[critical strike]]s. The class offers a variety of bonuses that involve criticals, such as [[power charge]] generation from [[Unstable Infusion]], conditional crit chance or damage based on enemy life threshold, the ability to apply a powerful {{il|Assassin's Mark}} with [[Deathmarked]], or roll for crits twice with [[Mystical Infusion]] with the downside of much less crit chance but chance for a higher crit damage multiplier.

[[Toxic Delivery]] grants bonuses to builds that utilise critical strikes with [[poison]], with [[Infused Toxins]] allowing all damage types to contribute to poison damage. On the defensive side, [[Mistwalker]] grants them [[Elusive]] on critical strike, [[Opportunistic]] grants a damage reduction with fighting multiple strong enemies, and [[Shadowed Blood]] grants physical damage life [[recoup]] and immunity to damage from ailments.

